◆ CONVERSATION                         │ ◆ COMPOSER
 Alt+Up / Down    Select messages      │  Cmd+Left / Right  Line start / end
 Enter or c       Copy selected item   │  Cmd+Backspace    Delete to line start
 e                Branch from prompt   │  Opt/Ctrl + Left/Right  Move by word
 Ctrl+O           Copy latest response │  Shift/Alt + Enter  Insert newline
                                       │  Alt+M            Select model
◆ DASHBOARD                            │  Alt+E            Select effort
 Ctrl+1 … Ctrl+4  Open a tab           │
 Alt+Left / Right  Previous / next tab │ ◆ APP
 Page Up / Page Down  Scroll this guide│  Ctrl+P           Command palette
                                       │  Ctrl+D           Toggle dashboard
◆ SESSIONS                             │  Ctrl+C           Interrupt / cancel
 Up/Down or j/k   Select session       │  Esc ×2           Exit application
 Enter or r       Resume session       │  Ctrl+N           New session
 f                Fork session         │
 a                Archive session      │ ◆ AGENTS
 u                Unarchive session    │  Enter            Focus / open log
 v                Active / archived    │  Up/Down or j/k   Select agent
 n                Rename session       │  g / G            First / last agent
 /                Search sessions      │  r                Reload open log
 d                Delete session       │
